  "days": 21,
  "content": "Before you share a dramatic photo, run these checks.\n\n1. **Reverse image search** it to see where it appeared first.\n2. **Look for clues**: signs, weather, shadows and language.\n3. **Check the source**: who posted it first, and are they reliable?\n\nMost viral fakes are real photos from a different time or place."
 }
